            "answer": "<p>Ninestep brushes are crafted in Germany using high-quality materials—natural sable or durable synthetic fibers. Each brush is designed specifically for the needs of model builders and tabletop painters, with shapes and sizes ideal for detail work, layering, and precision.</p>"
