          "settings": {
            "title": "Should I choose sable or synthetic brushes?",
            "answer": "<p>Sable brushes offer exceptional paint retention, a finer point, and a natural spring—ideal for blending, layering, and fine detail. Synthetic brushes are more affordable, solvent-resistant, and great for basecoating or working with metallics and washes. Many painters use both depending on the task.</p>"
