          "settings": {
            "title": "What paint types are Ninesteps brushes compatible with?",
            "answer": "<p>Ninestep brushes work well with acrylics, inks, enamels, and water-based paints. Sable brushes are best kept away from harsh solvents, while the synthetic range is more resistant to chemical wear.</p>"
