          "settings": {
            "title": "How should I clean and care for my brushes?",
            "answer": "<p>Rinse brushes thoroughly in clean water (or the appropriate thinner) after each session. Avoid letting paint dry in the bristles. Store them with the tip upright or flat and use a brush soap for deep cleaning. With proper care, Ninesteps brushes will last through many projects.</p>"
          }
