          "settings": {
            "title": "Which brush sizes are best for miniatures or models?",
            "answer": "<p>For fine detail on miniatures, sizes like 10/0 through 1 are ideal. For basecoating or drybrushing, larger sizes such as 3, 4, or 5 are more suitable. Flat brushes are great for smooth gradients, weathering, and broad surfaces.</p>"
